message: "If you use Mixture of Scars (MoS), SCache O(1), or ScarCodec in your research or engineering systems, please cite this work."
title: "Mixture of Scars (MoS) v4.0, SCache O(1), and Physical ScarCodec: Unified Native + WebGPU Scar Operators, Language-Nullspace 140 KB HTTP 206 Cartridges, and Domain-Independent Hardware/Signal Scars"
authors:
