repository-artifact: "https://github.com/byte-od/mixture-of-scars/releases/tag/v1.2.0-qwen72b-mos"
abstract: "Training-free Mixture of Scars v4.0 unifying Native (PyTorch, Apple Metal, CUDA Triton) and Zero-Python Browser (20 pure WGSL 1.0 compute shaders) directional residual operators across existing pretrained models (0.5B to 72.71B) and domain-independent physical hardware/signal systems (ScarCodec). Combines Sub-2-Bit (20.65 GiB shards / <24 GB VRAM at 72.71B), VQ4-Scar (<1.00 GiB 3B with exact (0,0,0,0) + D4 LUT256 + FWHT-64 + 2-Pass INT4-ASVD), ProtectedInt4Scar + ScriptSubspaceGate P_perp_CJK (1,601.57 MiB 3B at ~21 tok/s WebGPU with cos = 1.000000 parity), Language-Nullspace GoldenSliceScarStore v4.0 (41 x 140.00 KB RFC 7233 HTTP 206 cartridges across PT/EN/ES/FR at 164/164 = 100% and 0x00 GDPR wipe), Sinkhorn Re-Basin, SCache O(1) (32.9k Passkey 100% recall at 22.71 MiB +0 B drift), and standalone Physical ScarCodec (1,000x / +60 dB RFI cancellation via P_perp_RFI, exact 34,816 B / 34.8 KB black-box telemetry SCache O(1) with 100% early fault recall, and 12.05x CFD/HDR compression with O(1) random block access and 0.0 vacuum error)."
version: "4.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
